WEBVTT

00:11:59.513 --> 00:12:01.280
Like Notre Dame,

00:12:01.304 --> 00:12:05.496
we can't imagine how these
records will be used.

00:12:06.035 --> 00:12:08.599
But we know that they'll
be critically important.

00:12:10.053 --> 00:12:14.126
The Earth Archive is the ultimate gift
to future generations,

00:12:15.126 --> 00:12:16.591
because the truth be told,

00:12:17.638 --> 00:12:19.966
I won't live long enough
to see its full impact,

00:12:20.902 --> 00:12:22.331
and neither will you.

00:12:23.505 --> 00:12:26.027
That's exactly why it's worth doing.

00:12:27.218 --> 00:12:30.642
The Earth Archive is a bet
on the future of humanity.